<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Jobsite Credential Submitted</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; color: #474747; width: 100%; background-color: #fff; line-height: 1.6;">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="background-color: #004174; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center">
      <img
        src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801"
        alt="CVtoCAREER Logo"
        style="display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 149px; height: 32px"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div style="font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 32px; color: #474747; margin: 0 0 20px;">Jobsite Credential Submitted</h1>

      <div>
        <b style="display: block; margin-bottom: 16px;">Dear Team,</b>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">
          A client has submitted a jobsite application email and is now
          waiting on forwarding confirmation and admin approval.
        </p>

        <p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #004174; margin: 24px 0 8px;">📋 Submission Details</p>
        <div style="background-color: #f0f7fc; border-left: 4px solid #004174; padding: 16px; margin: 8px 0 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;"><strong>Client:</strong> <%= clientName %></p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;"><strong>Application email:</strong> <%= credentialEmail %></p>
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Status:</strong> Pending forwarding</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;">Best regards,<br />The CVtoCAREER System</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div
      style="
        padding: 16px 32px;
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        text-align: center;
      "
    >
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af">
        © <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
